.TH FLINT 1 "2026-11-24" "Flint 0.7.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
flint \- morning brief and AI session manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B flint
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B flint completion
\fIshell\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B flint
discovers recent sessions from supported AI coding CLIs, prints a grouped
morning brief and ranked focus list, and can reopen those sessions in your
terminal.
.PP
Supported adapters include Antigravity CLI, Claude Code, ChatGPT Codex, Cline,
OpenCode, and OpenClaw. MCP focus is optional and uses the most recent session's
host unless configured otherwise.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-summary
Print the summary only; do not launch sessions.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Print a machine-readable JSON document. This is read-only and skips the banner,
journal writing, and session launching.
.TP
.BR \-r ", " \-\-resume
Resume all matching sessions without prompting.
.TP
.BI \-\-limit " N"
Resume at most the N most recent non-running sessions.
.TP
.BI \-t ", " \-\-terminal " NAME"
Target terminal client, for example iterm2, ghostty, apple-terminal,
gnome-terminal, kitty, or windows-terminal.
.TP
.BI \-\-wrapper " NAME"
Prepend a launcher binary to every resume command.
.TP
.BI \-d ", " \-\-days " N"
Look back N days.
.TP
.BI \-\-hours " H"
Look back H hours.
.TP
.BI \-w ", " \-\-workspace " PATH"
Only include sessions whose workspace contains PATH.
.TP
.BR \-j ", " \-\-journal
Record the daily standup log in the journal repository.
.TP
.B \-\-weekly
Generate and display the weekly summary.
.TP
.B \-\-monthly
Generate and display the monthly summary.
.TP
.B \-\-mcp
Query connected MCP tools for focus items.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-mcp
Skip MCP queries for this run.
.TP
.BI \-c ", " \-\-config " PATH"
Use a custom configuration file.
.TP
.B \-\-init\-config
Generate the default configuration template.
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-dry\-run
Show commands without launching terminals.
.TP
.BR \-l ", " \-\-list\-terminals
List supported and detected terminal clients.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Print the Flint version.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print help.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BI completion " SHELL"
Print a completion script for bash, zsh, fish, or powershell.
.SH CONFIGURATION
Flint reads
.I ~/.config/flint/config
or
.I ~/.flintrc.
Global keys include terminal, resume_mode, journal_repo, lookback_hours,
open_in_tabs, auto_journal, mcp_focus, and mcp_host.
.PP
Per-tool sections such as [agy], [claude], [codex], [cline], [opencode], and
[openclaw] accept wrapper, model, and effort.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/flint/config
User configuration.
.TP
.I ~/.flintrc
Legacy configuration path.
.TP
.I ~/notes/flint-journal
Default journal repository.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B flint
Show the morning brief and choose sessions interactively.
.TP
.B flint \-\-json \-\-days 7
Emit JSON for the last seven days.
.TP
.B flint \-r \-n \-\-limit 3
Dry-run resuming the three most recent sessions.
.TP
.B flint completion zsh
Print a zsh completion script.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR git (1),
.BR claude (1),
.BR codex (1),
.BR opencode (1)
.SH VERSION
Flint 0.7.1
